 "paragraphs": [
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Continuous-Action RL",
   "hash": "6f086a72f06fb08584855048e1e6e0b9c0467ee56a230a86f4a38537cc553919",
   "id": "s0-title",
   "kind": "section_title",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 0
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "When a robot must set real-numbered turning forces, not pick fro",
   "hash": "998ba794bd20616ea4924bf780a002cbdeb0916cf099745b8226ff050e336308",
   "id": "s0-p1",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 0
  },
  {
   "domId": "continuous",
   "fp": "1 Robot arms set real-numbered turning forces",
   "hash": "f46da78611ea617f9a9e9eae6a69d0128ad124c9cfe3128b86929a97a40c9901",
   "id": "s1-title",
   "kind": "section_title",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": "continuous-arm",
   "fp": "1.1 A robot arm that turns at its joints",
   "hash": "f2e30e5f7584c6a3f398c94865d553c5b32f9666e6db71d799724e84dedf1f8a",
   "id": "s1-h1",
   "kind": "subhead",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "A robot arm must set real-numbered turning forces at its joints ",
   "hash": "afeddfa6bcb495adfb6bab45b2ef1ba4ede37109ec2ac596809961830f22ce6e",
   "id": "s1-p1",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "The agent is the learner that picks the moves. (RL Basics) A sta",
   "hash": "904432ef295d2476cd1104b81ea0dc395799a96c87dc875e55316d03323040c7",
   "id": "s1-p2",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 2,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "The running example is the Reacher task: a robot arm with two jo",
   "hash": "091f15051f927e5d88cdf2b49b6b70b589c81073e46591ccd337b12aaffa63d3",
   "id": "s1-p3",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 3,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": "rcaFig1",
   "fp": "Figure 1. The Reacher arm, with two joints, four torques and a m",
   "hash": "c335866960cd12ead3fba6c094d718f733b58e4f2e25a444eb894c000a9d9f2d",
   "id": "s1-f1",
   "kind": "figure",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Figure 1 shows the Reacher arm, with two joints, four torques an",
   "hash": "4b3eb858b4e209ccc125ebf7e07903a4ebfdb91657b2b0240006869ca3282eaa",
   "id": "s1-p4",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 4,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "A continuous action is a real number, or a list of them, that ca",
   "hash": "5905f90d2cb179157dee858612e6feb1ebc807670c025c4e79264a4503600d60",
   "id": "s1-p5",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 5,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": "continuous-list",
   "fp": "1.2 A list of torque levels is jerky and huge",
   "hash": "64165b91ef152c81c2fddbbf4bd5f4af82d3ab0e0c6601ed875f07a559e41a97",
   "id": "s1-h2",
   "kind": "subhead",
   "ordinal": 2,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "The return is all the reward still to come, with later rewards c",
   "hash": "0b598bfa27ee893bb945c8b825c289beb565d3fff6b644ecdb0d55f49bc93f80",
   "id": "s1-p6",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 6,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "DQN swaps the table for a network. A Q-network is a neural netwo",
   "hash": "550826880468ada8510e0e9ee85b9b13495f0a1194637eb729862096eabcbe0f",
   "id": "s1-p7",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 7,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "On the arm, a list of moves can only come from chopping each tor",
   "hash": "8ed8bcec4e012e53a371a1b3ab64e5f34e8ab2349244d4d9c0d661d228b2052f",
   "id": "s1-p8",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 8,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": "rcaFig2",
   "fp": "Figure 2. More levels on two torques makes the grid denser. The ",
   "hash": "c0e471b0373975dd203c3fb284bb3f3b0c3408e6941c15cf366810a668feb96c",
   "id": "s1-f2",
   "kind": "figure",
   "ordinal": 2,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Figure 2 shows two grids of allowed torque levels for two torque",
   "hash": "1692568d4c462e7c6d86a21b3ce549ac8c261eb543609fcd7458df0f6116c37d",
   "id": "s1-p9",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 9,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": "shared",
   "fp": "2 What every continuous-action method shares",
   "hash": "ab173d3941910831fa5156ee12e5bc3f207e27089e6ca774e09cc5550f7850a3",
   "id": "s2-title",
   "kind": "section_title",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": "shared-critic",
   "fp": "2.1 One network scores the state and the torques together",
   "hash": "0384b249238195c209bfae77ffa42dcceabefdd5c2ae5b529c9df06f72d3e8d5",
   "id": "s2-h1",
   "kind": "subhead",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "DDPG, TD3 and SAC use two networks. The critic is a network with",
   "hash": "aff526f996b7279d60881d2638aa1709dbbec807dff0a91440030c1425341820",
   "id": "s2-p1",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": "shared-actor",
   "fp": "2.2 A second network outputs the torques",
   "hash": "7d969011f8d71c1cfc758358bc98d0659fdee9b08bab222d2f5fc460d68c5c98",
   "id": "s2-h2",
   "kind": "subhead",
   "ordinal": 2,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "A policy is the agent’s rule for choosing a move in each state; ",
   "hash": "548e6a770e8d3a79726f4aa4d14af6b688426c6ab44cee358b40d818bf41b4b9",
   "id": "s2-p2",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 2,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "A deterministic actor outputs one set of torques every time. Wit",
   "hash": "bff846495ab45846c6c8d8e85ce84e1fae643af0dc88a3dccf89fe85372255dd",
   "id": "s2-p3",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 3,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "A stochastic actor draws its torques at random from a bell curve",
   "hash": "7cc3e6fc7c80ac6cb3734f1dc7d1c65a493e81397d798e0878cef97d6dc65c27",
   "id": "s2-p4",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 4,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": "stored-steps",
   "fp": "2.3 Learning from stored steps",
   "hash": "f0e3b80bcf6c46b526a670917a89b9ffab12793f9fbff870b79e340a355b85b5",
   "id": "s2-h3",
   "kind": "subhead",
   "ordinal": 3,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Off-policy means learning the values of one policy while playing",
   "hash": "e771d09863ff264a302e8d28b457e5614ae91e03950101738e82bd1412db8508",
   "id": "s2-p5",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 5,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "The critic learns by being pulled toward a target, the step’s re",
